      "content": "idk how to even explain it. it feels like everything is just... gone. like the person everyone knew, the one who had a life and a purpose, is just wiped. it's like i'm walking around but there's actually nothing there anymore. just a shell of someone that doesn't even exist in the real world. it's all just empty.",
