      "content": "it's just that the \"me\" that actually lived, the one that people interacted with, that version of me is 100% dead. it's not just a bad reputation or a setback, it's like the entire entity is gone. so i'm just sitting here in this body, but there's nobody actually home. it feels so wrong to even be taking up space when the person i was doesn't even exist anymore. it's like being a ghost that's still breathing.",
